1
00:00:00,563 --> 00:00:02,903
(Sheldon:)Perhaps what Leonard
is obliquely referring to...

2
00:00:03,066 --> 00:00:05,396
(Sheldon:)...is the occurrence
of sexual dysfunction.

3
00:00:05,568 --> 00:00:08,068
(Howard:)Okay, who had
Leonard gets a floppy disk?

4
00:00:08,237 --> 00:00:12,407
(Sheldon:)Oh. A clever, albeit obsolete, euphemism
for insufficient blood flow...

5
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:13,865
(Sheldon:)...to the male sex organ.

6
00:00:14,035 --> 00:00:15,705
[CHUCKLES]

7
00:00:16,496 --> 00:00:20,456
(Leonard:)Nothing like that happened, all right?
The sex was just fine.

8
00:00:20,917 --> 00:00:22,167
(Raj:)Just fine?

9
00:00:22,335 --> 00:00:26,635
(Raj:)Oh, dude, the fourth Harry Potter movie
was just fine.

10
00:00:26,798 --> 00:00:31,258
(Leonard:)I'm not saying it was bad.
I'm just saying it wasn't great.

11
00:00:31,427 --> 00:00:33,007
Okay, you mean for both of you?

12
00:00:33,179 --> 00:00:36,389
(Howard:)Because we can totally see it
not being great for her. Am I right?

13
00:00:37,391 --> 00:00:40,941
(Leonard:)To tell you the truth, I think
we were both a little-- I don't know--

14
00:00:41,104 --> 00:00:44,444
(Raj:)-Disappointed? Let down?
-Ashamed? Horrified? Repulsed?

15
00:00:44,607 --> 00:00:47,737
(Leonard:)All I know is
it wasn't the way I dreamed it would be.

16
00:00:47,902 --> 00:00:48,942
[SCOFFS]

17
00:00:49,112 --> 00:00:51,532
(Howard:)Sex is never the way
I dream it's gonna be.

18
00:00:53,282 --> 00:00:57,242
(Raj:)That's because in your dreams,
you're a horse from the waist down.

19
00:00:58,412 --> 00:01:03,872
Excuse me, Wolverine: Origin
Miniseries Issue 2, page 22.

20
00:01:04,043 --> 00:01:06,173
Retractable bone claws.

21
00:01:06,337 --> 00:01:10,427
If you spent less time thinking about sex
and more time on comic books...

22
00:01:10,591 --> 00:01:16,021
...we'd have far fewer
of these embarrassing moments.

